=00_Af-r0-OvnzWP1A4arVikXXoTIkZxQn_LMAc5Y9EWcF11Kg&oe=6A32ACC2"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=y2QF3-VRlMcQ7kNvwGDXGC4&_nc_oc=AdooPFBcN_Y8wGlWmj4O_IimTWhWkyJGdxiYcHFZBmCm4FH-32ZyIjSHQM2hkImDeHM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af85EBt8RXwHkAQ1O5ZuqES4bSqalB4dX3ihmuu36yKu5w&oe=6A32A23F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BiTeGtKknJ0Q7kNvwG3gOND&_nc_oc=AdpUFMa8AaXHvTZZSY9IG1skOy9KfKJ50ecFb2Wj0KvbBgIA7-Eo4MLi7j-oL3dLMzU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9sQb1-0MxwI7p4WFBuCVVc9A7iyDEjFJ5I1h_lA4_KWQ&oe=6A32B130"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quick reflexes to survive.\n\nDesigned for Meta Quest, Afterlife: Dead Zone delivers an immersive experience where you can only move physically within your designated play area, plunging you into a dark, destructive, and oppressive world.", "short_descr